  "created": "2026-10-29T02:31:33.89Z",
  "description": ".NET client for the Macula mesh: TLS 1.3 with a hybrid post-quantum key exchange, ML-DSA-87 identities, signed calls, replies and publications, handshake v5 (sessions bound to their TLS channel), and end-to-end sealing of calls, streams and realm groups with the caller's seal report. Node keys, a pool of station links, calls and streams by direct dial, serving in a node's own namespace or under an org, publish/subscribe and sealed group publish/subscribe, node-served content and the DHT. Built on libmacula, macula-go behind a C ABI, shipped in the package for Linux (x64, arm64), macOS (x64, arm64) and Windows (x64).",
